*.sms binary
*.gg binary
*.sg binary
*.rom binary
*.bin binary
*.tap binary
*.tzx binary
*.z80 binary
*.sav binary
*.state* binary
*.autostate binary

# Imágenes y documentos
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.xcf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.blend binary
*.odt binary
*.pdf binary
*.xls binary
